      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "LONE FORCE (4) ran a nice race last time out over 1609m at Townsville, finishing fourth and beaten 2.5 lengths after being prominent at the turn. Finds an easier assignment and can get the job done. FISTSOFFURY (3) made progress last time out, finishing 3 lengths from the winner in third when he made late ground at the end of 1450m at Cairns. Ideally placed and is sure to prove tough to beat. BANG STICK (1) was out of the money when resuming two runs back then just missed the frame last start over 1250m at Cairns, beaten 4.5 lengths into fifth. Perfectly placed and is sure to take plenty of stopping. CYCLONE COCO (5) was beaten 3 lengths into sixth at the second run back from a break in a 1210m contest at Mareeba a week-and-a-half ago. Better than recent efforts suggest and may earn some minor money.",
